{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32248","headline":"经故秘书崔监扬州南塘旧居 · 温庭筠","name":"经故秘书崔监扬州南塘旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔年曽识谢宣城，松竹风姿鹤性情。\n唯向旧山留月色，偶逢秋涧似琴声。\n乗舟覔吏经舆县，爲酒求官得步兵。\n玉柄寂寥谭客散，却寻池阁泪纵横。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32248.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32248","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}